From 996a8c8f8a69cee3a06ab37804a65908f4c43b60 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Danila Tikhonov <danila@jiaxyga.com>
Date: Wed, 10 Apr 2024 20:46:50 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 084/194] media: qcom: camss: Add SM7150 resources

This commit describes the hardware layout for the SM7150 for the
following hardware blocks:

- 4 x CSI PHY
- 2 x CSID
- 2 x VFE, 4 RDI per VFE
- 1 x VFE Lite, 4 RDI per VFE

Signed-off-by: Danila Tikhonov <danila@jiaxyga.com>
---
 drivers/media/platform/qcom/camss/camss.c | 203 ++++++++++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 203 insertions(+)

diff --git a/drivers/media/platform/qcom/camss/camss.c b/drivers/media/platform/qcom/camss/camss.c
index 2123f6388..6f36a28fb 100644
